26
00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:08.760
I use my fair share of apps.

27
00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:10.140
I'm currently on a pause.

28
00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:12.600
I felt like everybody I was swiping through,

29
