31
00:01:16.810 --> 00:01:20.320
And it was exhausting and time consuming.

32
00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:23.090
And I just felt like it was going nowhere.

33
00:01:23.090 --> 00:01:27.340
I'm 36 years old, so I don't have forever.

34
00:01:27.340 --> 00:01:29.850
